        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-aculeatus-benthic-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-two-sample-ks-distance-between-plate-and-readout-profiles>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-aculeatus-benthic-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-aculeatus-benthic-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2> ;
