<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-gasterosteus-aculeatus-benthic-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-gasterosteus-aculeatus-benthic-turing-wavelength-s0-5> a schema:QuantitativeValue,
